{"name":"Brushstroke","hex":"#f1dfba","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"brushstroke","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The stroke of a brush, as in painting."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/brushstroke"}],"entries":[{"title":"Brushstroke","blocks":[{"text":"Brushstroke is a sculpture by Roy Lichtenstein. There are two copies. The original was created in 2001 for the Museo Nacional Centro de Arte Reina Sofía in Madrid, Spain. The second was delivered to the Hirshhorn Museum and Sculpture Garden in Washington, DC, on September 16, 2003, and dedicated on October 25, 2003."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/52/Brushstroke.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brushstroke","wikidata":"Q4979739"},{"title":"Brushstroke (restaurant)","blocks":[{"text":"Brushstroke was a restaurant in New York City. The restaurant operated from 2011 to 2018, and had received a Michelin star."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brushstroke_(restaurant)","wikidata":"Q121590637"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Blue-Beige Gradient","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Blue-Beige_Gradient.jpg/500px-Blue-Beige_Gradient.jpg","ratio":1.6,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Blue-Beige_Gradient.jpg","share":0.405},{"title":"Horizontal brushstrokes","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Horizontal_brushstrokes.JPG/500px-Horizontal_brushstrokes.JPG","ratio":1.6080402010050252,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Horizontal_brushstrokes.JPG","share":0.071875},{"title":"Tweedelige japon, knielange rok (2) van wit-beige stof in linnenlook met mouwloze hes (1) met naturel passement met kralenborduursel, “Cargelli”, objectnr 61920-1-2","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/47/Tweedelige_japon%2C_knielange_rok_%282%29_van_wit-beige_s